 "level_notes": {
  "1": "The PPL reference lives as Markdown in the opensearch-project/sql repository (docs/user/ppl, also rendered on docs.opensearch.org); the ANTLR grammar is the precise syntax definition.",
  "0": "opensearch-project/sql (Java) implements both OpenSearch SQL and PPL: ANTLR lexer/parser, AstBuilder, analyzer and a Calcite-based planner.",
  "3": "No dedicated encyclopedia entry; Wikipedia covers OpenSearch only."
